{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Samiddhi","html":"<article id='thag1.46'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Theragāthā 1.46 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Verses of the Senior Monks 1.46 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Pañcamavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Chapter Five </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Samiddhittheragāthā </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Samiddhi </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Saddhāyāhaṁ pabbajito, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>I went forth out of faith </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Agārasmānagāriyaṁ; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>from the lay life to homelessness. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Sati paññā ca me vuḍḍhā, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>My mindfulness and wisdom have grown, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Cittañca susamāhitaṁ; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>my mind is serene. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Kāmaṁ karassu rūpāni, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Make whatever illusions you want, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Neva maṁ byādhayissasī”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>it doesn’t bother me. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>… Samiddhitthero …. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
